{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3455890690d674d822ae33b27425a1081575997145940a007164989763bc8ec6", "ja": "（桃子とあずささんが警察もののドラマに出演する。\n撮影も佳境に入って、大忙しだ……！）", "zh": "（桃子和阿梓要出演一部警匪剧。拍摄已经进入最后阶段，正忙得不可开交……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "2432a86d4bdfe40d3144a977a4b625661f94709189087f0dcbbca4b767b9df43", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、両手を上げて！\n観念して、大人しくしなさい！", "zh": "哥哥，举起双手！\n束手就擒，老实点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0be410ba19e21b287b65d87852c4a61e0e6d946d9eb9e1e0afed7189797b420f", "ja": "わっ！　ど、どうしたんだ、桃子！？", "zh": "哇！怎、怎么了，桃子！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "1967a2ef1b450d31e0a53664227c3feaabf2d34bcc09b74dbc191f4a7925c227", "ja": "お兄ちゃんを重要参考人として逮捕します。", "zh": "我要以重要嫌疑人的身份逮捕哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "663ed619ec746839f622835d5fe07fcf5faa74ff51d2614db63adcc13b3da956", "ja": "コホン。これから事情聴取を始めます。重要参考人は\n正直に質問に答えるように！　いいですか？", "zh": "咳咳。从现在开始问话。重要嫌疑人要老老实实回答问题！明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9e65d134dae150e4be20167896ef7981af01df930a393f7354b9954173c8d383", "ja": "は、はい。わかりました……。", "zh": "好、好的。我知道了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "da9364df59f9133ae0ac623bda59329585b203c4e65d680cd29a665e3d39bd66", "ja": "じゃあまず……\nお兄ちゃん、今日はちゃんと休憩とりましたか？", "zh": "那么首先……\n哥哥，今天有好好休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1449f598c37164f0fd063ea8745b9e17e12916c02a5da3393cd47d52df534e19", "ja": "休憩？　今日はバタバタしていたからな……\nでも、お昼ご飯はしっかり食べたよ。", "zh": "休息？今天一直忙得团团转……\n不过，午饭还是好好吃过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "0845cebc6bbb81a5304809c0a10c68956c90b350f43dc4154b1c2ddc75ae093e", "ja": "ふんふん、なるほど。じゃあ次、この前の\nお休みだけど……まさか、お仕事はしてないよね？", "zh": "嗯嗯，原来如此。那么接下来是关于上次休息日的事……你该不会还在工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1010_p", "source_sha256": "464858493944bd9ca06c41fc933d71274ca444da8eb869225f6945d7a4f3091c", "ja": "えっと……資料作りとか企画書の準備を少し。\n週明けのためにやっておこうと思って……。", "zh": "那个……我稍微做了些资料和企划书的准备。\n想着为下周先做一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "5492d9664f0d360a3d1bd21220c7dea53c270e4b00f4c4aaee674b2575f3c783", "ja": "やっぱり……。わかりました。\nそれじゃ、これから桃子が判決を下します！", "zh": "果然……我知道了。\n那么，桃子现在就要下达判决了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1012_p", "source_sha256": "88c66ae2adf22812bf255117a6ae41d818d6a35a85dbe46c54cb9aca6effc633", "ja": "（判決って、それは裁判なんだけど……\n今言ったら怒られそうだから、黙っておこう）", "zh": "（所谓判决，那可是法庭上的事啊……现在说出来感觉会被她骂，还是闭嘴吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "3e5ba1500eac67ac8ba49373139df8f2c3224b2ed82498f0a760f50b9ac6c2d3", "ja": "お兄ちゃんはズバリ、がんばりすぎ！\nもっと休憩して、ちゃんと休みながら働くこと！", "zh": "哥哥你啊，实在是太拼命了！\n要多休息，劳逸结合地工作才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2f162d1ff3e20b7f5e54a51a51a496796067a3ffa4c03658a4b80ef192d349a8", "ja": "うっ……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "bc564d6274826a7daff023fa224033bbce6dede233b020b2afed3e8fb7e1effd", "ja": "桃子たちのために、って気持ちは嬉しいけど、\nそれで倒れちゃったりしたら、意味ないでしょ？", "zh": "你说是为了桃子她们，这份心意我很高兴，可要是因此累倒了，不就没有意义了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "0319250bf6d5f1a4ae92767a403621c8be57365f8ec3499b76a51bdda4ec6c40", "ja": "自己管理も、お仕事のうちだよ。そうじゃないと、\n周りの人達に心配かけちゃうんだから。", "zh": "自我管理也是工作的一部分哦。不然的话，会让身边的人担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1017_p", "source_sha256": "38060ec7ada2ed6152d73c7b00f2c1e6d9858594292cc29ca7167f879097605c", "ja": "そうだな……。桃子の言う通りだ。\n今日から無理しないように気をつけるよ。", "zh": "是啊……桃子说得对。从今天开始，我会注意不再勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0683_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "b1ab6ef9d2a081f9799a15cafde54ea21c6d603855937c15a7900ac25becfef3", "ja": "うん！　これからも、たまにチェックに来るからね。\n桃子巡査の目を、かいくぐれると思わないこと。いい？", "zh": "嗯！我以后也会偶尔过来检查的。\n别以为能躲过桃子巡警的眼睛。听见了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
